      "Type": "PIP",
      "Language": "eng",
      "AbstractText": "Mortality from ischemic heart disease and cerebrovascular disease among native Greenlanders is studied and compared with sex-specific rates in Denmark. Living conditions, nutrition, and genetic predisposition are considered as factors influencing these causes of death."
